	(embedded_fonts no)
	(text "RECOVERY: hold SW6 before cold power-on. SW6 / J3.7 -> R33 1k -> PC1 / U2.56 (FEL_N).\nR34 10k pulls FEL_N to switched 3V3. BOOT_SEL[1:0] remains 11 on PC3 / PC2.\nJ3.7: open-drain LOW or release only. BROM tries UART upgrade before USB. See FEL_REPAIR_CN.md."
		(at 38.1 358.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2cb3185c-309c-56bb-9c63-42a22dd71197")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY GPIO: PA8 (U2.66) -> LCD_RST; PA9 / EINT9 (U2.65) <- LCD_TE. Both use 1V8.\nR32 10k holds reset LOW at boot. R29 must remain fitted 0R; VDDIO must share the PA supply.\nUpdate firmware pin assignments; PD19 / PD20 are now unconnected. See DISPLAY_IO_REPAIR_CN.md."
		(at 38.1 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c92bdda6-ffe8-592d-8700-9558d0d22a41")
	)
